            NOTHING
        OTHERWISE
            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "To be eligible to issue benefits under this subsection, a State agency shall comply with reporting requirements established by the Secretary to carry out this subsection."
            JUST FALSE

-- src:1118 | (4) Plan
-- src:1119 | To be eligible to issue benefits under this subsection, a State agency shall—
-- src:1120 | (A) submit a plan to the Secretary that describes the conditions and procedures under which the benefits will be issued, including eligibility standards, benefit levels, and the methodology the State agency will use to determine amounts due the Secretary under paragraph (2); and
-- src:1121 | (B) obtain the approval of the Secretary for the plan.
